0019: def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
0020:     """
0021:     Fill each black 5x5 region's missing interior positions with a fixed 3x3 positional color legend.
0022: 
0023:     Input structure
0024:     - The grid uses teal as the dominant background and black for one or more
0025:       5x5 regions.
0026:     - Each black region has a black one-pixel border and a 3x3 interior that
0027:       may already contain teal pixels.
0028: 
0029:     Rule
0030:     - Overlay the legend 1 7 6 / 4 8 5 / 2 9 3 on the 3x3 interior of every
0031:       5x5 black region.
0032:     - Wherever an interior non-center legend position is still black, recolor it
0033:       to the corresponding legend color; leave existing teal pixels, the center,
0034:       and the black border unchanged.
0035: 
0036:     Key insight
0037:     - The colored output pixels are not derived from the teal motif shape; they
0038:       are the fixed position labels for the missing cells of each 3x3 interior.
0039:     """
